<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-ST CAPITAL 1H PROFIT DOWN 32.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ST CAPITAL 1H PROFIT DOWN 32.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   6.29   vs   9.36</p>
<p>    Group shares (cts)		 4.40   vs   6.50</p>
<p>    Net interest income	     13.42   vs  12.29</p>
<p>    Net income from</p>
<p>	   interest rate swaps	 0.78   vs   1.37</p>
<p>    Net Operating lease income     1.69   vs   2.17</p>
<p>    Other income			 3.35   vs   2.05</p>
<p>    Profit after direct expenses  19.23   vs  17.87</p>
<p>    Other expenses		    11.72   vs   5.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     7.52   vs  12.20</p>
<p>    Tax				    1.22   vs   2.84</p>
<p>Note - ST Capital Ltd is a uinit of Singapore Technologies Industrial Corp.</p>
